(Information Security & Telemetry Data Protection Policy) '
(Document Code: POL-SEC-01 | Version: v2.0) '
(Organization: AeroPulse Avionics & Autonomous Systems Inc.) '
(-------------------------------------------------------) '
() '
(Section 1.1: Telemetry Data Encryption & Key Management) '
(All flight telemetry data, ground control communication links, and) '
(command packets shall be encrypted in transit using AES-256-GCM.) '
(Cryptographic session keys must be rotated every 24 hours. Under no) '
(circumstances may plaintext telemetry be transmitted over public RF or) '
(LTE channels.) '
() '
(Section 2.4: Telemetry Log Retention Requirements) '
(All autonomous flight logs, command sequences, and pilot overrides) '
(shall be archived in immutable, encrypted cold storage for a mandatory) '
(minimum period of 7 years in compliance with FAA SMS 14 CFR Part 5.) '
(Deletion prior to 7 years is strictly prohibited.) '
() '
(Section 3.2: Multi-Factor Authentication on Ground Stations) '
(All mission controllers and flight software operators must) '
(authenticate using hardware FIDO2 security keys and biometric MFA) '
(before issuing motor arming commands or uploading flight trajectories.) '
ET
endstream
